From 2da63166a151156c70bfa897826ac4fb9aa7a2fe Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Security fix <fix@local>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 14:04:01 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Security hardening: Supabase Auth, RLS, server-side API keys,
 locked-down edge functions

- Stop tracking .env.local and supabase/.temp; remove hardcoded Google key and stale insecure root index.ts
- Migration: role-based RLS on all tables, anon denied, api_credentials locked, legacy password column dropped
- Client: sign in via Supabase Auth; every request uses the user's JWT; profile/role from crm_me(); no data read before sign-in
- Edge functions: require signed-in CRM user, CORS allow-list, keys read server-side; add hunter-search and admin-users
- Fix dlog/dwarn infinite recursion when debug is enabled
- Docs: SECURITY_HARDENING.md runbook; remove 'disable RLS' advice
